# [MLOps][DVC] Pillar 2 — data versioning.
# The materialized dataset snapshot is versioned by DVC (tracked via the small
# triage_dataset.npz.dvc pointer that IS committed to git), NOT by git directly —
# large binaries don't belong in git. The lineage metadata record
# (triage_dataset.meta.json) IS committed as the human-readable data-version anchor.
/triage_dataset.npz
